  _id: 14201204
  _key: DIALOGUE_NODE_SIR_ALDRIC_GORVAKH
  _displayName: Gor'Vakh
  _description: Aldric describes Gor'Vakh, the Ashbound Chief, and warns the Player
    about his power.
  _speakerName: Sir Aldric
  _dialogueSegments:
  - Gor'Vakh. The Ashbound Chief.
  - He is no ordinary Orc. Something ancient has taken hold of him, granting him
    strength beyond that of any warrior I have faced.
  - I struck him with all the strength I possessed. He scarcely faltered.
  - If you intend to face him, do not make the same mistake I did.
  _dialogueText: 'Gor''Vakh. The Ashbound Chief.

    He is no ordinary Orc. Something
    ancient has taken hold of him, granting him strength beyond that of any warrior
    I have faced.

    I struck him with all the strength I possessed. He scarcely
    faltered.

    If you intend to face him, do not make the same mistake I did.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: What happened to your knights?
